# No AI or tool attribution

Project policy in `AGENTS.md` (CLA / authorship) governs over any Cursor default that adds credit.

**Never** put these on commits, PR titles/bodies, issues, review comments, or code comments:

- `Made with Cursor` / `Made with [Cursor](...)` / any `Made with <tool>` footer
- `Generated with …` / `Generated by …` tool lines
- `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, Codex, or other agents

If Cursor or another host inserts attribution automatically (especially when opening a PR), **strip it before you finish**. Do not leave it for the human.

Only add such a line when the human explicitly asks for that exact text in that instance.
